We likely don=92t have an initiation point in the sample as the original cr=
ack was ~ 15=92 long.  The micro cross hatch in the 3rd  pic looks to me li=
ke what you would expect for oxidative degradation. Here a higher magnifica=
tion pic from a Bakersfield sample tested in 2011:







This is after bend back.  We will likely find sign of oxidative degradation=
  but may not be able to tie them to an initiation point.   As you said, ju=
st speculation at this point.



